               <history>
                  <origin>
                     <origPlace>
                        <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/INS0105DD">Dabra Dāmmo ʾAbuna ʾAragāwi</placeName>
                     </origPlace>
                     <origDate notBefore="1750" notAfter="1950" evidence="lettering" cert="medium">The manuscript was likely produced sometime between the second part of the 18th century and
                        the first part of the 20th century.</origDate> The manuscript consists of two codicological units. <ref target="#p1"/> was produced sometime between the second part of the 18th century and 
                     the first part of the 19th century. <ref target="#p2"/> was added later, most likely in the first half of the 20th century. 
                  </origin>
                  <provenance>The manuscript was donated by <persName role="donor" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15246MaharitaMar">Maḥarita Māryām</persName> 
                     to the community of <placeName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/INS0105DD">Dabra Dāmmo</placeName> (see the supplications in <ref target="#p1"/>). 
                     <ref target="#p2"/> was most likely produced at the instigation of <persName role="other" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS15247GabraEgzia">Gabra ʾƎgziʾabǝḥer</persName>, who is mentioned as a supplicant in 
                     <ref target="#p2_i1"/>.</provenance>
               </history>
                  
